              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eno eli ijwi lyakuti “Kwasyaala lumwi luzutu” nkukwaamba kuti kuyoososololwa zeezyo zizungaanizigwa, mbuli zintu izyakalengwa buyo, kuti ezyo zitazungaanizikwa zikasyaale, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.27",
